#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Nā kiʻi paʻi o kou helehelena i hoʻohālikelike ʻia e Ubuntu Hello. E mālama "
"ma lalo o ʻelua, i hoʻopaʻa ʻia i nā kukui ʻokoʻa."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Hōʻike i nā kumu hoʻohālike i mālama ʻia no:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Hoʻokahi wale nō hiʻohiʻona maka i kākau inoa ʻia. Hoʻololi ke kukui i ke "
"ʻano o kou helehelena i ka pahupaʻikiʻi, no laila hiki ke hāʻule hoʻokahi "
"kumu hoʻohālike i ke ahiahi ma lalo o nā kukui (a i ke ao paha). E hoʻohui i "
"kahi kumu hoʻohālike ʻelua i hoʻopaʻa ʻia i nā kukui ʻokoʻa e hoʻomau i ka "
"wehe ʻana i hilinaʻi i kēlā me kēia manawa o ka lā."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Hoʻohui i kahi hoʻohālike lua"

